invariant: INV-33
file: webpki.c
catches: webpki_chain_test
reason: the walk reports anchor 0 whichever anchor verified, so the pins
  compare against a root that did not sign the path. The capture rows,
  whose chains end at anchors 2, 3 and 4, and the re-keyed root, whose
  real key sits at index 1, object.

--- old
            out->anchor_index = (uint8_t)anchor;
--- new
            out->anchor_index = 0;
